    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d388">

                <pb facs="0550" n="508" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg508"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1863-02-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 10, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: Referring to your private memorandum of
                    the 19th ultimo, relative to Francis Carroll, and to my reply, I now have the
                    honor to inform you that, under date of the 7th instant, he was ordered to be
                    discharged from Fort Lafayette on his parole, to report forthwith, personally,
                    to General Schenck for further order, and that General Schenck has been advised
                    thereof.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, your very obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
